Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 23:18:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/19] fix(eval): keep Molmo in fp32 and stop Ray co-locating
 the two large tools

vlm.py hardcoded torch_dtype="auto" and ignored the dtype field, so the
paper's numbers were produced with Molmo in fp32 (~30 GB) despite the config
saying float16. Now that vlm.py honours the field, request "auto" explicitly
so runtime behaviour stays identical to upstream.

fp32 Molmo (30 GB) plus RoboRefer (17 GB) fits an 80 GB A100 -- the hardware
the paper used -- but not a 48 GB A6000. Ray packs fractional GPUs, so 0.5 +
0.5 puts both on GPU 0 and OOMs. Raising both to 0.55 makes them mutually
exclusive (1.1 > 1.0) without changing any replica count; the tool total stays
at exactly 2.00, leaving 2.00 for the policy.
---
 examples/toolshed/run_eval.sh | 12 ++++++------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/examples/toolshed/run_eval.sh b/examples/toolshed/run_eval.sh
index e2061ac6..587f2fd9 100755
--- a/examples/toolshed/run_eval.sh
+++ b/examples/toolshed/run_eval.sh
@@ -137,10 +137,10 @@ ray.init(address="auto")
 from toolshed import start_toolkit
 roborefer_model, depth_checkpoint = sys.argv[1], sys.argv[2]
 TOOL_CONFIGS = {
-    'roborefer': {'num_actors': 1, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.5}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-roborefer', 'timeout': 600,
+    'roborefer': {'num_actors': 1, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.55}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-roborefer', 'timeout': 600,
         'args': {'model_path': roborefer_model, 'no_output_image': True, 'no_output_vars': False, 'exclude_methods': ['general_query'], 'exclude_behavior': 'error'}},
-    'vlm': {'num_actors': 1, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.5}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-vlm', 'timeout': 600,
-        'args': {'no_output_image': True, 'no_output_vars': False, 'model_name': 'allenai/Molmo-7B-D-0924', 'dtype': 'float16', 'exclude_methods': ['general_query'], 'exclude_behavior': 'error'}},
+    'vlm': {'num_actors': 1, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.55}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-vlm', 'timeout': 600,
+        'args': {'no_output_image': True, 'no_output_vars': False, 'model_name': 'allenai/Molmo-7B-D-0924', 'dtype': 'auto', 'exclude_methods': ['general_query'], 'exclude_behavior': 'error'}},
     'sam2': {'num_actors': 2, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.15}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-vlm', 'timeout': 600, 'args': {'no_output_image': True, 'no_output_vars': False}},
     'depth_estimator': {'num_actors': 2, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.15}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-vlm', 'timeout': 600,
         'args': {'checkpoint_path': depth_checkpoint, 'no_output_image': True, 'no_output_vars': False}},
@@ -159,10 +159,10 @@ ray.init(address="auto")
 from toolshed import start_toolkit
 roborefer_model, depth_checkpoint = sys.argv[1], sys.argv[2]
 TOOL_CONFIGS = {
-    'roborefer': {'num_actors': 1, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.5}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-roborefer', 'timeout': 600,
+    'roborefer': {'num_actors': 1, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.55}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-roborefer', 'timeout': 600,
         'args': {'model_path': roborefer_model, 'no_output_image': True, 'no_output_vars': False, 'exclude_methods': ['general_query'], 'exclude_behavior': 'error'}},
-    'vlm': {'num_actors': 1, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.5}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-vlm', 'timeout': 600,
-        'args': {'no_output_image': True, 'no_output_vars': False, 'model_name': 'allenai/Molmo-7B-D-0924', 'dtype': 'float16', 'exclude_methods': ['general_query'], 'exclude_behavior': 'error'}},
+    'vlm': {'num_actors': 1, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.55}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-vlm', 'timeout': 600,
+        'args': {'no_output_image': True, 'no_output_vars': False, 'model_name': 'allenai/Molmo-7B-D-0924', 'dtype': 'auto', 'exclude_methods': ['general_query'], 'exclude_behavior': 'error'}},
     'sam2': {'num_actors': 2, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.15}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-vlm', 'timeout': 600, 'args': {'no_output_image': True, 'no_output_vars': False}},
     'depth_estimator': {'num_actors': 2, 'resources': {'num_gpus': 0.15}, 'conda_env': 'spacetools-tool-vlm', 'timeout': 600,
         'args': {'checkpoint_path': depth_checkpoint, 'no_output_image': True, 'no_output_vars': False}},
